                                "accessibilityText" : "Indicating that I have entered all the information and data required in this account for the purpose of submitting a housing support request to the Ministry of Housing (the Ministry), I pledge and agree to all of the following points:\n\nAll data, information and facts that I will enter, and all documents and documents submitted by me or that I will submit for the purpose of obtaining housing support are true and complete and reflect the reality to date and do not include any incorrect or contradictory data.\n\nI will not conceal any information that has been requested.\n\nI will update any of the information and data I entered immediately and with complete accuracy if any of that information changes during the period from the date of this acknowledgment until the date of allocating the housing support to me.\n\nIf it appears to the Ministry that I submitted incorrect information or data, or that any of the statements contained in this declaration is incorrect, or that I did not disclose information that was requested to be disclosed, or that I did not update the information and data that I provided as soon as it changed, the Ministry may take the legal measures contained in the regulation of housing support against me Including the exclusion of my application and the refund of housing support (if I obtained it) in addition to referring me to the competent authority to impose legal penalties on me.\n\nThe Ministry has the right to ensure that the conditions for entitlement to housing support are available to me, and for this purpose it has the right to examine the information, data and facts that I will enter and any documents or documents submitted by me and verify their validity by all legal means, in addition to obtaining any information or data of me with the authorities governmental or private.\n\nThe Ministry has the right to obtain from credit companies a copy of my credit record, and this acknowledgment 